      "data": {
        "title": "Continuous, or at the same fixed thresholds the level bands already use?",
        "question": "Should positions compact smoothly as zoom changes, or only snap at the same band boundaries (glyph/icon/summary/detail) the workspace system already has, so there is no new threshold vocabulary to learn?",
        "status": "answered",
        "answer": "Answered: there is no repack to trigger, since positions never move. What needs a trigger is switching between authored views, and that already exists — each view claims a resolution on the 0-3 scale, and the highest one at or below the current resolution is shown (viewResolution.js). No new trigger concept is needed.",
        "definitionKey": "idea-question",
